PeOS: under an asset root of archives only, a path no archive has is
missing, without looking for it on the disk (exists/is_file/is_directory,
read_file, materialize, disk_path). Each such lookup walked the folders
through the disk: 820,000 disk reads every 10 s of a 550 s load on the
MacBook Pro 2019 (2026-11-15).

